ber to avoid timeouts.'=>'Eyi n jẹ ki Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi rẹ ti a ṣe eto ṣiṣẹ ni awọn ẹka. Ti o ba ni akoonu pupọ, ṣeto eyi si nọmba kekere lati yago fun akoko idaduro.','Batches wait time'=>'Akoko idaduro fun awọn ẹka','This is the wait time (in seconds) between processing batches of Auto Terms. If you have a lot of existing content, set this to a higher number to avoid timeouts.'=>'Eyi ni akoko idaduro (ni awọn aaya) laarin ṣiṣe awọn ẹka ti Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi. Ti o ba ni akoonu ti o wa tẹlẹ pupọ, ṣeto eyi si nọmba ti o ga julọ lati yago fun akoko idaduro.','24 hours ago'=>'Awọn wakati 24 sẹyin','7 days ago'=>'ọjọ 7 seyin','2 weeks ago'=>'ọsẹ 2 seyin','1 month ago'=>'osù 1 seyin','6 months ago'=>'oṣù 6 seyin','1 year ago'=>'ọdún 1 seyin','Limit Auto Terms, based on published date'=>'Limiti Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi, da lori ọjọ ti a tẹjade','This setting can limit your scheduled Auto Terms query to only recent content. We recommend using this feature to avoid timeouts on large sites.'=>'Eto yi le dinku ibeere Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi ti a ti ṣeto rẹ si akoonu tuntun nikan. A ṣe iṣeduro lilo ẹya yii lati yago fun akoko idaduro lori awọn aaye nla.','Save Settings'=>'Fipamọ Eto','Test Run'=>'Idanwo Iṣe','Recent Schedule Runs'=>'Awọn Iṣe Akoko Tuntun','You can see full log details on the %1s screen'=>'O le rii awọn alaye igbasilẹ kikun lori iboju %1s','Auto Terms Logs'=>'Awọn Igbasilẹ Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi','Terms Display'=>'Afihan Awọn Ọrọ','Terms Display successfully deleted.'=>'Afihan Awọn Ọrọ ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Post Type'=>'post type','Cloud'=>'Ibi ipamọ','WordPress Default'=>'WordPress Default','Table List'=>'Atokọ Tabili','Border Cloud'=>'Ibi ipamọ Ààlà','Parent / Child'=>'Iya / Ọmọ','Add New Terms Display'=>'Ṣe afikun Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ Tuntun','This feature allows you to create a customizable display of all the terms in one taxonomy.'=>'Ẹya yii n jẹ ki o ṣẹda ifihan ti a le ṣe adani ti gbogbo awọn ọrọ ni taxonomy kan.','Search Terms Display'=>'Wa Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Manage Terms Display'=>'Ṣakoso Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Preview Terms Display'=>'Ṣayẹwo Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Move up'=>'Gbe soke','Move down'=>'Gbe silẹ','Edit Terms Display'=>'Ṣatunkọ Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Add new Terms Display'=>'Ṣe afikun Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ tuntun','To create more Terms Display, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'Lati ṣẹda diẹ ẹ sii Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Terms Display. You can create Terms Display for any taxonomy and then display those Terms Display anywhere on your site.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, o le ṣẹda Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ ailopin. O le ṣẹda Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ fun eyikeyi taxonomy ki o si fi awọn Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ wọle ni ibikibi lori aaye rẹ.','Choose Terms'=>'Yan Awọn Ọrọ','Exceptions'=>'Awọn Ẹtọ','Display Format'=>'Fọọmu Ifihan','Hide title in output?'=>'Tọju akọle ninu abajade?','All post types'=>'Gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ','All Parent Terms'=>'Gbogbo Awọn Ọrọ Obi','Parent Term'=>'Ọrọ Obi','Display only Parent Terms'=>'Fihan awọn Ọrọ Obi nikan','Display only Sub-Terms'=>'Fihan awọn Sub-Ọrọ nikan','Display Parents and Sub-Terms'=>'Fihan Awọn obi ati Awọn ọrọ-ọrọ','Display Mode'=>'Fihan Ipo','Term selection mode'=>'Ipo yiyan ọrọ','Automatic'=>'Aifọwọyi','Display terms based on settings in the "General" tab.'=>'Fihan awọn ọrọ da lori awọn eto inu taabu "Gbogbogbo".','Custom'=>'Aṣ customized','Display only the specific terms entered in the "Custom terms to display" field below.'=>'Fihan nikan awọn ọrọ pato ti a tẹ sinu aaye "Awọn ọrọ aṣa lati fi han" ni isalẹ.','Combined'=>'Papọ','Display automatic terms plus any additional custom terms specified below.'=>'Fihan awọn ọrọ aifọwọyi pẹlu eyikeyi awọn ọrọ aṣa afikun ti a tọka ni isalẹ.','Custom terms to display'=>'Awọn ọrọ aṣa lati fi han','Enter terms (comma-separated) to display. Used in Custom and Combined modes.'=>'Tẹ awọn ọrọ (ti a ya pẹlu koma) lati fi han. Ti lo ninu awọn ipo Aṣ customized ati Papọ.','Limit terms based on timeframe'=>'Dena awọn ọrọ da lori akoko','Ascending'=>'Iwọn','Descending'=>'Iwọra','Ordering for choosing terms for display'=>'Iṣeto fun yiyan awọn ọrọ lati fi han','Text to display before terms list'=>'Ọrọ lati fi han ṣaaju akojọ awọn ọrọ','Enter the text that should be display before terms list. This field accepts basic HTML.'=>'Tẹ ọrọ ti o yẹ ki o han ṣaaju akojọ awọn ọrọ. Aaye yii gba HTML ipilẹ.','Text to display after terms list'=>'Ọrọ lati fi han lẹhin akojọ awọn ọrọ','Enter the text that should be display after terms list. This field accepts basic HTML.'=>'Tẹ ọrọ ti o yẹ ki o han lẹhin akojọ awọn ọrọ. Aaye yii gba HTML ipilẹ.','Exclude terms from terms display'=>'Yọ awọn ọrọ kuro ninu ifihan awọn ọrọ','Enter terms (comma-separated) to exclude from the terms display.'=>'Tẹ awọn ọrọ (ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu koma) lati yọkuro lati inu iṣafihan awọn ọrọ.','Exclude hidden terms from Terms Display?'=>'Ṣe yọ awọn ọrọ ti a pamọ kuro ni Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ?','Hide display output if no terms?'=>'Tẹsiwaju ifihan jade ti ko ba si awọn ọrọ?','Maximum terms to display'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn ọrọ lati ṣe afihan','This is the color of the least popular term'=>'Eyi ni awọ ti ọrọ ti o kere julọ popular','This is the color of the most popular term'=>'Eyi ni awọ ti ọrọ ti o pọ julọ popular','Term display div class'=>'Kilasi div iṣafihan ọrọ','This option allows you to change the format of your terms. You can use any of the tokens in the "Terms Display format" sidebar". Find more details %1sin the documentation%2s.'=>'Aṣayan yii n jẹ ki o yipada ọna kika ti awọn ọrọ rẹ. O le lo eyikeyi ninu awọn token ni " ọna kika Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ " ẹgbẹ ". Wa alaye diẹ sii %1sin ninu iwe afọwọkọ %2s.','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free.
                                        The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'O nlo PublishPress Taxonomies Free.
                                        Ẹya Pro ni diẹ sii awọn ẹya ati atilẹyin.','Font size minimum must not be greater than Font size maximum value.'=>'Iwọn font ti o kere julọ ko gbọdọ jẹ diẹ sii ju Iwọn font ti o pọ julọ lọ.','Save Terms Display'=>'Fipamọ Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ','Add Terms Display'=>'Fi Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ kun','Terms Display format'=>'Ọna kika Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ','Here are the tokens you can use for Term link format'=>'Eyi ni awọn token ti o le lo fun ọna kika ọna asopọ Ọrọ','The URL of the term'=>'URL ti ọrọ naa','The ID of the term'=>'ID ti ọrọ naa','The weighted size of the term in the display'=>'Iwọn ti o ni iwuwo ti ọrọ naa ninu iṣafihan','The number of times the term is used'=>'Iye igba ti ọrọ naa ti lo','This provides rel tag markup'=>'Eyi n pese markup tag rel','it creates'=>'o ṣẹda','The font size for the term'=>'Iwọn font fun ọrọ naa','The font color for the term'=>'Color font fun ọrọ naa','The name of the term'=>'Orukọ ọrọ naa','The name of the term with any HTML stripped out'=>'Orukọ ọrọ naa pẹlu eyikeyi HTML ti a yọkuro','The description of the term'=>'Apejuwe ọrọ naa','Invalid nonce'=>'Nonce ti ko tọ','Missing display ID.'=>'ID ifihan ti o padanu.','Invalid terms display configuration.'=>'Iṣeto ifihan awọn ọrọ ti ko tọ.','There are no terms in this taxonomy.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy yii.','Please provide a taxonomy to delete'=>'Jọwọ pese taxonomy kan lati pa','Please provide a taxonomy name'=>'Jọwọ pese orukọ taxonomy kan','Object'=>'Ohun','%s has been successfully added'=>'%s ti ṣafikun ni aṣeyọri','%s has failed to be added'=>'%s ti kuna lati fi kun','%s has been successfully updated'=>'%s ti ṣe imudojuiwọn ni aṣeyọri','%s has failed to be updated'=>'%s ti kuna lati ṣe imudojuiwọn','%s has been successfully deleted'=>'%s ti pa ni aṣeyọri','%s has failed to be deleted'=>'%s ti kuna lati pa','Nonce failed verification'=>'Iṣeduro nonce kuna','Please choose a different taxonomy name. %s is already registered.'=>'Jọwọ yan orukọ taxonomy oriṣiriṣi. %s ti forukọsilẹ tẹlẹ.','Please provide a post type to attach to.'=>'Jọwọ pese iru ifiweranṣẹ kan lati so pọ pẹlu.','Please choose a different post type name. %s matches an existing page slug, which can cause conflicts.'=>'Jọwọ yan orukọ iru ifiweranṣẹ miiran. %s baamu pẹlu slug oju-iwe ti o wa tẹlẹ, eyi le fa ikolu.','Please do not use quotes in post type/taxonomy names or rewrite slugs'=>'Jọwọ ma ṣe lo awọn ikọwe ninu awọn orukọ iru ifiweranṣẹ/taxonomy tabi tun kọ awọn slug','%s has been successfully imported'=>'%s ti wa ni aseyori ti a mu wa','%s has failed to be imported'=>'%s ti kuna lati jẹ a mu wa','Add new %s'=>'Fi %s tuntun kun','Edit %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','New %s'=>'Tuntun %s','View %s'=>'Wo %s','All %s'=>'Gbogbo %s','Search %s'=>'Wa %s','No %s found.'=>'Ko si %s ti a ri.','No %s found in trash.'=>'Ko si %s ti a ri ninu ikogun.','Popular %s'=>'Olokiki %s','Parent %s'=>'Iya %s','Parent %s:'=>'Iya %s:','Update %s'=>'Imudojuiwọn %s','New %s name'=>'Orukọ %s tuntun','Separate %s with commas'=>'Ya %s sọtọ pẹlu awọn komma','Add or remove %s'=>'Fi %s kun tabi yọ %s','Choose from the most used %s'=>'Yan lati inu %s ti a lo jùlọ','Kindly select an action in bulk action dropdown!'=>'Jọwọ yan iṣe kan ninu dropdown iṣe pọ!','Kindly select atleast one taxonomy to proceed'=>'Jọwọ yan o kere ju taxonomy kan lati tẹsiwaju','Taxonomy has been successfully deactivated'=>'Taxonomy ti wa ni deactivated ni aṣeyọri','Taxonomy has been successfully activated'=>'Taxonomy ti wa ni activated ni aṣeyọri','Taxonomy has been successfully deleted'=>'Taxonomy ti wa ni paarẹ ni aṣeyọri','Are you sure you want to delete this? Deleting will NOT remove created content.'=>'Ṣe o dajudaju pe o fẹ paarẹ eyi? Iparẹ kii yoo yọ akoonu ti a ṣẹda kuro.','Please select at least one post type.'=>'Jọwọ yan o kere ju ọkan post type.','Taxonomy slug cannot be numbers only.'=>'Taxonomy slug ko le jẹ awọn nọmba nikan.','Taxonomies'=>'taxonomies','Add New'=>'Fi Tuntun Kun','This feature allows you to create new taxonomies and edit all the settings for each taxonomy.'=>'Ẹya yii ngbanilaaye fun ọ lati ṣẹda awọn taxonomy tuntun ati satunkọ gbogbo awọn eto fun ọkọọkan taxonomy.','Search Taxonomies'=>'Wa Taxonomies','All Taxonomies'=>'Gbogbo Taxonomies','Public Taxonomies'=>'Taxonomies Awujọ','Private Taxonomies'=>'Taxonomies Ikọkọ','All Post Types'=>'Gbogbo Post Types','Invalid nonce. Request is not authorized.'=>'Nonce ti ko tọ. Ibeere ko ni aṣẹ.','You do not have permission to view terms in this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati wo awọn ọrọ ni taxonomy yii.','Unable to retrieve terms for this taxonomy.'=>'Ko le gba awọn ọrọ fun taxonomy yii.','Manage Taxonomy'=>'Ṣakoso Taxonomy','Edit Taxonomy'=>'Ṣatunkọ Taxonomy','Add new Taxonomy'=>'Fi Taxonomy tuntun kun','Permalinks'=>'Permalinks','Admin Area'=>'Ibi Isakoso','Other Labels'=>'Awon Aami Mẹta','REST API'=>'REST API','Order'=>'Ibere','Slug'=>'Slug','Deactivate or Delete'=>'Dena tabi Pa','Taxonomy Slug'=>'Taxonomy Slug','Slug has changed'=>'Slug ti yipada','Slug already exists'=>'Slug ti wa tẹlẹ','Special character not allowed in slug.'=>'A ko gba aami pataki laaye ninu slug.','The “slug” is the URL-friendly version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'“slug” ni ẹya URL-ore ti orukọ. O maa n jẹ gbogbo lẹta kekere ati pe o ni awọn lẹta, awọn nọmba, ati awọn aami isalẹ nikan.','DO NOT EDIT the taxonomy slug unless also planning to migrate terms. Changing the slug registers a new taxonomy entry.'=>'Ẹ má ṣe Ṣatunkọ slug taxonomy ayafi ti o ba tun gbero lati gbe awọn ọrọ. Iyipada slug naa forukọsilẹ ohun titun ninu taxonomy.','Migrate terms to newly renamed taxonomy?'=>'Gbe awọn ọrọ si taxonomy ti a tun pe ni tuntun?','(e.g. Jobs)'=>'(àpẹẹrẹ: Jobs)','Plural Label'=>'Aami Plural','(e.g. Job)'=>'(àpẹẹrẹ: Job)','Singular Label'=>'Aami Alailẹgbẹ','Parent-Child Relationships'=>'Ibasepọ Ẹbi-Ọmọ','Can terms in this taxonomy be organized into hierarchical relationships?'=>'Ṣe awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy yii le ṣeto sinu ibasepọ ilana?','Description'=>'Apejuwe','Describe what your taxonomy is used for.'=>'Ṣalaye ohun ti taxonomy rẹ jẹ fun.','Default Terms'=>'Awọn Ọrọ Aiyipada','Set the default terms for this taxonomy. These will be automatically added to all new posts. Enter the term names or slugs. Separate multiple terms with by comma.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ọrọ aiyipada fun taxonomy yii. Awọn wọnyi yoo jẹ afikun laifọwọyi si gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ tuntun. Tẹ awọn orukọ ọrọ tabi awọn slugs. Ya awọn ọrọ pupọ pẹlu koma.','Archive page result'=>'Abajade oju-iwe Archive','Normally, WordPress will only show one post type on taxonomy archive pages. Enable this feature to show content from all selected posts types.'=>'Nigbagbogbo, WordPress yoo fihan iru ifiweranṣẹ kan nikan lori awọn oju-iwe archive taxonomy. Mu ẹya yii ṣiṣẹ lati fihan akoonu lati gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan.','Rewrite'=>'Tun kọ','WordPress can use a custom permalink for this taxonomy. It does not have to match the slug.'=>'WordPress le lo permalink aṣa fun taxonomy yii. Ko ni lati ba slug mu.','(default: taxonomy name)'=>'(aiyipada: orukọ taxonomy)','Custom Rewrite Slug'=>'Slug Tun Kọ Aṣa','Custom taxonomy rewrite slug.'=>'Slug tun kọ aṣa fun taxonomy.','Rewrite With Front'=>'Tun Kọ Pẹlu Ibi iwaju','Should the permastruct be prepended with the front base.'=>'Ṣe permastruct yẹ ki o wa ni pejọ pẹlu ipilẹ iwaju.','Rewrite Hierarchical'=>'Tun Kọ Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe','Should the permastruct allow hierarchical urls.'=>'Ṣe permastruct yẹ ki o jẹ ki awọn URLs ilana?','Show user interface'=>'Fihan oju-iwe olumulo','Should there be a visible interface in the WordPress admin area to manage these terms?'=>'Ṣe yẹ ki o wa oju-iwe ti o han ni agbegbe admin WordPress lati ṣakoso awọn ọrọ wọnyi?','Show in admin menus'=>'Fihan ninu awọn akojọ aṣayan admin','Should there be links to this taxonomy in the WordPress admin menus?'=>'Ṣe awọn ọna asopọ si taxonomy yii wa ninu awọn akojọ aṣayan admin WordPress?','Show in frontend menus'=>'Fihan ninu awọn akojọ aṣayan iwaju','Should this taxonomy be available for the frontend “Menus” and “Navigation” options?'=>'Ṣe taxonomy yii yẹ ki o wa fun awọn aṣayan “Akojọ” ati “Iṣakoso” ni iwaju?','Show admin column'=>'Fihan ọwọn admin','Should a column for this taxonomy appear on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'Ṣe ọwọn fun taxonomy yii yẹ ki o han lori awọn iboju bii “Posts” ati “Pages”?','Show in "Quick Edit" and "Bulk Edit"'=>'Fihan ninu "Ṣatunkọ Yara" ati "Ṣatunkọ Ọpọlọpọ"','Should this taxonomy be available in editing tools on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'Ṣe taxonomy yii yẹ ki o wa ninu awọn irinṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ lori awọn iboju bii “Posts” ati “Pages”?','Show in Filter'=>'Fihan ninu If фильtir','Should this taxonomy be available in filters on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'Ṣe taxonomy yii yẹ ki o wa ninu awọn if фильtir lori awọn iboju bii “Posts” ati “Pages”?','Menu Name'=>'Orukọ Akojọ','Custom admin menu name for your taxonomy.'=>'Orukọ akojọ admin ti aṣa fun taxonomy rẹ.','(e.g. All Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Gbogbo Iṣẹ)','All Items'=>'Gbogbo Awọn nkan','Used as tab text when showing all terms for hierarchical taxonomy while editing post.'=>'Lo bi ọrọ taabu nigbati o ba n fihan gbogbo awọn ofin fun taxonomy hierarchical nigbati o n ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ.','(e.g. Edit Job)'=>'(e.g. Ṣatunkọ Iṣẹ)','Edit Item'=>'Ṣatunkọ Nkan','Used at the top of the term editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'Lo ni oke iboju olootu ofin fun ofin taxonomy ti o wa tẹlẹ.','(e.g. View Job)'=>'(e.g. Wo Iṣẹ)','View Item'=>'Wo Nkan','Used in the admin bar when viewing editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'Lo ninu bar admin nigbati o ba wo iboju olootu fun ọrọ taxonomy ti o wa.','(e.g. Update Job Name)'=>'(e.g. Ṣatunkọ Orukọ Iṣẹ)','Update Item Name'=>'Ṣatunkọ Orukọ Ohun','Custom taxonomy label. Used in the admin menu for displaying taxonomies.'=>'Aami taxonomy aṣa. Lo ninu akojọ aṣayan admin fun ifihan taxonomies.','Update %s name'=>'Ṣatunkọ orukọ %s','(e.g. Add New Job)'=>'(e.g. Fi Iṣẹ Tuntun Kún)','Add New Item'=>'Fi Ohun Tuntun Kún','Used at the top of the term editor screen and button text for a new taxonomy term.'=>'Lo ni oke iboju olootu ọrọ ati ọrọ bọtini fun ọrọ taxonomy tuntun.','(e.g. New Job Name)'=>'(e.g. Orukọ Iṣẹ Tuntun)','New Item Name'=>'Orukọ Ohun Tuntun','(e.g. Parent Job)'=>'(e.g. Iṣẹ Obi)','Parent Item'=>'Ohun Obi','(e.g. Parent Job:)'=>'(e.g. Iṣẹ Obi:)','Parent Item Colon'=>'Kolon Ohun Obi','(e.g. Search Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Wa Awọn Iṣẹ)','Search Items'=>'Wa Awọn Ohun','(e.g. Popular Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Awọn Iṣẹ Olokiki)','Popular Items'=>'Awọn Ohun Olokiki','(e.g. Separate Jobs with commas)'=>'(e.g. Ya Awọn Iṣẹ pẹlu awọn koma)','Separate Items with Commas'=>'Ya Awọn Ohun pẹlu Awọn Koma','(e.g. Add or remove Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Fi kun tabi yọ Jobs)','Add or Remove Items'=>'Fi kun tabi Yọ Items','(e.g. Choose from the most used Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Yan lati inu Jobs ti a lo julọ)','Choose From Most Used'=>'Yan Lati Inu Ti A Lo Jùlọ','(e.g. No jobs)'=>'(e.g. Ko si Jobs)','No terms'=>'Ko si awọn ofin','Used when indicating that there are no terms in the given taxonomy associated with an object.'=>'Lo nigba ti o ba tọka pe ko si awọn ofin ninu taxonomy ti a fun ni ti a so pọ pẹlu ohun kan.','No %s'=>'Ko si %s','(e.g. Jobs list navigation)'=>'(e.g. naviagtion atokọ Jobs)','Items List Navigation'=>'Navigation Atokọ Items','Screen reader text for the pagination heading on the term listing screen.'=>'Ọrọ ti a fi han nipasẹ titẹ ‘Yan lati inu awọn ohun ti a lo julọ’ ninu apo meta taxonomy nigbati ko si awọn ohun ti o wa.','%s list navigation'=>'%s navigation atokọ','(e.g. Jobs list)'=>'(e.g. atokọ Jobs)','Items List'=>'Atokọ Items','Screen reader text for the items list heading on the term listing screen.'=>'Ọrọ ti a fi han fun akọle atokọ awọn ohun lori iboju atokọ awọn ofin.','%s list'=>'%s atokọ','(e.g. No jobs found)'=>'(e.g. Ko si jobs ti a ri)','Not Found'=>'Ko ri','The text displayed via clicking ‘Choose from the most used items’ in the taxonomy meta box when no items are available.'=>'Ọrọ ti a fi han nipa titẹ ‘Yan lati inu awọn ohun ti a lo julọ’ ninu apo meta taxonomy nigba ti ko si awọn ohun ti o wa.','No %s found'=>'Ko si %s ti a ri','(e.g. &larr; Back to jobs'=>'(e.g. &larr; Pada si awọn iṣẹ','Back to Items'=>'Pada si Awọn nkan','The text displayed after a term has been updated for a link back to main index.'=>'Iwe ọrọ ti a fihan lẹhin ti a ti ṣe imudojuiwọn ọrọ fun ọna asopọ pada si itọsọna akọkọ.','Back to %s'=>'Pada si %s','Show in REST API'=>'Fihan ninu REST API','Add the taxonomy to the WordPress wp-json API.'=>'Fi taxonomy kun si WordPress wp-json API.','REST API base slug'=>'REST API ipilẹ slug','The base slug that this taxonomy will use in the REST API.'=>'Slug ipilẹ ti taxonomy yii yoo lo ninu REST API.','REST API controller class'=>'REST API oludari kilasi','The name of a custom Rest Controller class instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'Orukọ kilasi ti adani Rest Controller dipo WP_REST_Terms_Controller.','Custom controller to use instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'Oludari adani lati lo dipo WP_REST_Terms_Controller.','Public'=>'Gbogbo eniyan','The taxonomy is for public use. It can be seen by frontend users.'=>'Taxonomy yii jẹ fun lilo gbogbo eniyan. O le jẹri nipasẹ awọn olumulo iwaju.','Public Queryable'=>'Gbogbo eniyan Queryable','The taxonomy is publicly queryable.'=>'Taxonomy yii jẹ queryable gbogbogbo.','Query Var'=>'Query Var','Enable a custom query_var key for this taxonomy.'=>'Mu bọtini query_var adani ṣiṣẹ fun taxonomy yii.','Custom Query Var String'=>'Custom Query Var String','Sets a custom query_var slug for this taxonomy.'=>'Ṣeto slug query_var adani fun taxonomy yii.','Metabox callback'=>'Metabox ipe','Sets a callback function name for the meta box display. Hierarchical default: post_categories_meta_box, non-hierarchical default: post_tags_meta_box. To remove the metabox completely, use "false".'=>'Ṣeto orukọ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe isọdọtun fun ifihan apoti meta. Aiyipada hierarchial: post_categories_meta_box, aiyipada ti kii ṣe hierarchial: post_tags_meta_box. Lati yọ apoti meta patapata, lo "false".','Categories'=>'Ẹka','This feature controls the order of %s when you\'re editing posts, and in frontend displays.'=>'Ẹya yii n ṣakoso aṣẹ ti %s nigba ti o n satunkọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ, ati ni awọn ifihan iwaju.','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ aṣẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering for this taxonomy in the frontend and admin area.'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ aṣẹ Taxonomies PublishPress fun taxonomy yii ni iwaju ati agbegbe admin.','Re-activate Taxonomy'=>'Tun-ṣiṣẹ Taxonomy','Deactivate Taxonomy'=>'Pa Taxonomy','Delete Taxonomy'=>'Paarẹ Taxonomy','Delete PublishPress Taxonomies Edit Data'=>'Paarẹ Data Iṣatunṣe Taxonomies PublishPress','You can only delete taxonomies created with PublishPress Taxonomies. However, you can delete any changes or edit made from PublishPress Taxonomies which will remove PublishPress Taxonomies version edit restoring original taxonomies data or removing it if already deleted'=>'O le paarẹ taxonomies ti a ṣẹda pẹlu Taxonomies PublishPress nikan. Sibẹsibẹ, o le paarẹ eyikeyi awọn ayipada tabi iṣatunkọ ti a ṣe lati Taxonomies PublishPress eyiti yoo yọ ẹya iṣatunkọ Taxonomies PublishPress pada si data taxonomies atilẹba tabi yọ rẹ ti o ba ti paarẹ tẹlẹ','Save Taxonomy'=>'Fipamọ Taxonomy','Add Taxonomy'=>'Fi Taxonomy kun','Term copied successfully.'=>'Term ti daakọ ni aṣeyọri.','Term deleted successfully.'=>'Term ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Term removed from all posts successfully.'=>'Term ti yọkuro lati gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Count'=>'Iye','Custom URL'=>'URL aṣa','Synonyms'=>'Synonyms','Linked Terms'=>'Awọn Ọrọ Ti a So','Status'=>'Ipo','Copy'=>'Daakọ','Select Destination Taxonomy'=>'Yan Taxonomy Ibi-afẹde','Search posts'=>'Wa awọn ifiweranṣẹ','post type'=>'post type','Select Destination %s'=>'Yan Ibi-afẹde %s','Filter'=>'Ṣ filter','Terms deleted successfully.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Term(s) copied successfully.'=>'Ọrọ(ọrọ) ti daakọ ni aṣeyọri.','Hidden'=>'Tẹ́lẹ̀','Live'=>'Gba laaye','No terms found.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ti a rii.','Quick edit &#8220;%s&#8221; inline'=>'Ṣatunkọ yarayara &#8220;%s&#8221; inline','Quick&nbsp;Edit'=>'Ṣatunkọ&nbsp;Yarayara','Remove From All Posts'=>'Yọ Kúrò Ninu Gbogbo Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ','View'=>'Wo','Quick Edit'=>'Ṣatunkọ Yarayara','Cancel'=>'Fagilee','Update'=>'Imudojuiwọn','Terms'=>'Awọn ọrọ','This screen allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'Ibuwọlu yi gba ọ laaye lati wa ati ṣatunkọ gbogbo awọn ọrọ lori aaye rẹ.','This screen allows you to order terms via drag and drop.'=>'Ibo yi n gba ọ laaye lati paṣẹ awọn ọrọ nipasẹ gbigbe ati ju silẹ.','Search Terms'=>'Wa Awọn Ọrọ','Media Tags'=>'Awọn aami Media','Media Tag'=>'Aami Media','All Media Tags'=>'Gbogbo Awọn aami Media','Edit Media Tag'=>'Ṣatunkọ Aami Media','View Media Tag'=>'Wo Aami Media','Update Media Tag name'=>'Mẹta orukọ Aami Media','Add new Media Tag'=>'Fi Aami Media tuntun kun','New Media Tag name'=>'Orukọ Aami Media Tuntun','Parent Media Tag'=>'Aami Media Obi','Parent Media Tag:'=>'Aami Media Obi:','Search Media Tags'=>'Wa Awọn aami Media','Popular Media Tags'=>'Awọn aami Media Ti o gbajumọ','Separate Media Tags with commas'=>'Ya Awọn aami Media pẹlu awọn koma','Add or remove Media Tags'=>'Fi tabi yọ Awọn aami Media','Choose from the most used Media Tags'=>'Yan lati inu awọn aami Media ti a lo julọ','No Media Tags found'=>'Ko si Awọn aami Media ti a rii','No Media Tags'=>'Ko si Awọn aami Media','Media Tags list navigation'=>'Iṣakoso atokọ Awọn aami Media','Media Tags list'=>'Atokọ Awọn afi Media','Back to Media Tags'=>'Padà si Awọn afi Media','PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Search PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Wa Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Edit PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Ṣatunkọ Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Update PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Mọ́lẹ̀ Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Add New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Fikun-un Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress Tuntun','New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress Tuntun','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free. The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'O n lo Taxonomies PublishPress Free. Version Pro ni awọn ẹya diẹ sii ati atilẹyin.','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'Gba Version Pro ti Taxonomies PublishPress','Enhance the power of PublishPress Taxonomies with the Pro version:'=>'Mu agbara ti Taxonomies PublishPress pọ pẹlu version Pro:','Unlimited “Term Display”'=>'“Iṣafihan Ọrọ” ailopin','Unlimited “Terms for Current Posts”'=>'“Awọn Ọrọ fun Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ” ailopin','Unlimited “Related Posts”'=>'“Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan” ailopin','Unlimited “Auto Links”'=>'“Awọn ọna asopọ aifọwọyi” ailopin','Unlimited “Auto Terms”'=>'“Awọn Ọrọ aifọwọyi” ailopin','Create new terms using OpenAI and other sources'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ọrọ tuntun nipa lilo OpenAI ati awọn orisun miiran','Use Linked Terms'=>'Lo Awọn Ọrọ Ti o Ni Asopọ','Use Synonyms'=>'Lo Awọn Ọrọ Itumọ','Schedule Auto Terms to run automatically'=>'Gbero Awọn Ọrọ aifọwọyi lati ṣiṣẹ laifọwọyi','Control the display of term metaboxes'=>'Ṣakoso ifihan ti term metaboxes','Fast, professional support'=>'Atilẹyin iyara, ọjọgbọn','No ads inside the plugin'=>'Ko si ipolowo ninu plugin','Need PublishPress Taxonomies Support?'=>'Ṣe o nilo Atilẹyin PublishPress Taxonomies?','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'Ti o ba nilo iranlọwọ tabi ni ibeere ẹya tuntun, jẹ ki a mọ.','Request Support'=>'Beere Atilẹyin','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ alaye wa ni oju opo wẹẹbu plugin naa.','View Knowledge Base'=>'Wo Ibi imọ','OpenAI Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ OpenAI','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate OpenAI to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ OpenAI lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','IBM Watson Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ IBM Watson','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Watson to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ Watson lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','Dandelion Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ Dandelion','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Dandelion to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ Dandelion lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','LSEG / Refinitiv Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ LSEG / Refinitiv','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate LSEG / Refinitiv to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ LSEG / Refinitiv lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','Suggest terms using AI'=>'Daba awọn ọrọ nipa lilo AI','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati daba awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo OpenAI. Iṣẹ yii le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ tuntun.','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the IBM Watson. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati daba awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo IBM Watson. Iṣẹ yii le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ tuntun.','Copy with Metadata'=>'Daakọ pẹlu Metadata','Auto terms using AI'=>'Awọn ọrọ aiyipada nipa lilo AI','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to generate new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and add new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo awọn iṣẹ OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion ati Open Calais. Awọn iṣẹ wọnyi le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si fi awọn ọrọ tuntun kun.','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati daba awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo awọn iṣẹ OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion ati Open Calais. Awọn iṣẹ wọnyi le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ tuntun.','Add Custom Elements'=>'Ṣafikun Awọn eroja Aṣ customized','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ni iṣakoso pipe lori ibiti a ti fi Awọn ọna asopọ Aiyipada kun. O le yan lati fo awọn eroja HTML ti o han ninu akoonu rẹ.','Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms'=>'Lo Awọn ifaminsi deede lati yi Awọn ọrọ Aiyipada pada','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use this feature.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati yi bi Awọn ọrọ Aiyipada ṣe n ṣe itupalẹ awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ. Iwọ yoo nilo lati mọ bi a ṣe le kọ Awọn ifaminsi deede lati lo ẹya yii.','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also.'=>'Ẹya yii n gba ọ laaye lati so awọn ọrọ pọ. Nigbati ọrọ akọkọ tabi eyikeyi ninu awọn ọrọ wọnyi ba fi kun si ifiweranṣẹ, gbogbo awọn ọrọ miiran yoo tun fi kun.','Linked Terms Feature'=>'Ẹya Awọn ọrọ asopọ','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization across your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda awọn asopọ to lagbara laarin awọn ọrọ rẹ. Nigbati a ba fi ọrọ kan kun si ifiweranṣẹ, awọn ọrọ asopọ rẹ le fi kun laifọwọyi. Eyi n ṣe iranlọwọ lati ṣetọju iṣeto to ni ibamu ni gbogbo akoonu rẹ.','This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For example, "website" can have synonyms such as "websites", "web site", and "web pages".'=>'Ẹya yi n gba ọ laaye lati so awọn ọrọ afikun pọ pẹlu ọkọọkan ọrọ. Fun apẹẹrẹ, "weebụsaịtị" le ni awọn ọrọ aiyipada bii "weebụsaịtị", "weebụ aaye", ati "weebụ oju-iwe".','Synonyms Terms Feature'=>'Ẹya Awọn ọrọ aiyipada','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ọrọ ti a so pọ pẹlu ọrọ kan. Ti PublishPress Taxonomies ba ṣe iwadii akoonu rẹ ki o si ri ọrọ aiyipada, yoo ṣiṣẹ bi ẹnipe o ti ri ọrọ akọkọ.','Taxonomy Display'=>'Ifihan Taxonomy','This feature is available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'Ẹya yii wa ni PublishPress Taxonomies Pro','Customize the display of terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'Ṣatunkọ ifihan awọn ọrọ ninu metabox PublishPress Taxonomies.','Options include checkboxes and a dropdown list.'=>'Awọn aṣayan pẹlu awọn apoti ayẹwo ati atokọ dropdown.','Copy Term with Metadata'=>'Daakọ Ọrọ pẹlu Metadata','To Copy terms with their metadata, please upgrade to pro.'=>'Lati Daakọ awọn ọrọ pẹlu metadata wọn, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn si pro.','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can duplicate taxonomy terms along with all their metadata. This includes term descriptions, images, and custom fields. You can copy terms between taxonomies to maintain consistent organization across your site.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, o le daakọ awọn ọrọ taxonomy pọ pẹlu gbogbo metadata wọn. Eyi pẹlu awọn apejuwe ọrọ, awọn aworan, ati awọn aaye aṣa. O le daakọ awọn ọrọ laarin awọn taxonomy lati ṣetọju iṣeto to ni ibamu ni gbogbo aaye rẹ.','Choose the display formats of your terms, options include table list, ordered list, border-cloud and lots more.'=>'Yan awọn ọna kika ifihan ti awọn ọrọ rẹ, awọn aṣayan pẹlu atokọ tabili, atokọ ti a paṣẹ, awọ-ọwọ ati ọpọlọpọ diẹ sii.','Hourly'=>'Lọ́ọ́rẹ́','Daily'=>'Ọjọ́','Pro Feature'=>'Ẹ̀ya Pro','Some of these features are available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn ẹya wọnyi wa ni PublishPress Taxonomies Pro','ID'=>'ID','Name (Pro)'=>'Orukọ (Pro)','Counter (Pro)'=>'Kọ́ńtà (Pro)','Random (Pro)'=>'Aiyé (Pro)','Term Order (Pro)'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ (Pro)','Method for choosing terms for display'=>'Ọna fun yiyan awọn ọrọ fun ifihan','Name'=>'Orukọ','Counter'=>'Kọ́ńtà','Term Order'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ','Disabled'=>'Ti a dènà','You have disabled PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'O ti dènà awọn aṣẹ PublishPress Taxonomies','Terms in this taxonomy are ordered by %s'=>'Awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy yii ni a paṣẹ nipasẹ %s','Term Order(Pro)'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ (Pro)','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to use Term Order to manually order Terms'=>'Ṣatunkọ si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro lati lo Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ lati paṣẹ awọn ọrọ ni ọwọ','Request completed.'=>'Ìbéèrè ti pari.','Security error. Kindly reload this page and try again'=>'Aṣiṣe aabo. Jọwọ tun gbe oju-iwe yi ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi','Permission error. You do not have permission to manage PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'Aṣiṣe igbanilaaye. Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso PublishPress Taxonomies','Posts content and title is empty.'=>'Akopọ ati akọle awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ṣofo.','Permission error. You do not have permission to preview this post.'=>'Aṣiṣe igbanilaaye. Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati wo ifiweranṣẹ yi.','You do not have permission to manage this taxonomy. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso taxonomy yi. Mu Metabox Access Taxonomies ṣiṣẹ fun ipa yi ni %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.','Too many AI preview requests. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'Ọpọ awọn ibeere AI ti o yẹwo. Jọwọ duro fun iṣẹju kan ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Term Results'=>'Awọn Abajade Ọrọ','No results found for this post with this taxonomy.'=>'Ko si awọn abajade ti a ri fun ifiweranṣẹ yi pẹlu taxonomy yi.','Invalid Auto Term ID. Please save the settings before using preview.'=>'ID Ọrọ Aifọwọyi ti ko tọ. Jọwọ fipamọ awọn eto ṣaaju lilo iwoye.','You must enable at least one AI integration source to use auto term preview.'=>'O gbọdọ mu orisun iṣọpọ AI kan ṣiṣẹ o kere ju lati lo iwoye ọrọ aifọwọyi.','This Auto Terms option is not enabled for metaboxes. Please enable it in the Auto Terms settings.'=>'Yiyan Ọrọ Aifọwọyi yi ko ti mu ṣiṣẹ fun metaboxes. Jọwọ mu ṣiṣẹ ni awọn eto Ọrọ Aifọwọyi.','Click %1s to select or deselect them from this %2s.'=>'Tẹ %1s lati yan tabi yọ wọn kuro ninu %2s yi.','Suggest Existing Terms'=>'Ṣe iṣeduro Awọn Ọrọ to wa','OpenAI'=>'OpenAI','IBM Watson'=>'IBM Watson','Dandelion'=>'Dandelion','LSEG / Refinitiv'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv','Update %1s on this %2s'=>'Imudojuiwọn %1s lori %2s yi','Existing Terms not found for the selected post type and taxonomies'=>'Ko si Awọn Ọrọ to wa ti a ri fun iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a ti yan ati taxonomies','Existing Terms taxonomy is required. Kindly select taxonomies and save the settings before running preview.'=>'Taxonomy Awọn Ọrọ to wa jẹ dandan. Jọwọ yan awọn taxonomy ki o si fipamọ awọn eto ṣaaju ṣiṣe iwoye.','Result from ajax request.'=>'Abajade lati ibeere ajax.','The selected taxonomy is not associated with the selected post type.'=>'Taxonomy ti a yan ko ni asopọ pẹlu post type ti a yan.','No results found for this taxonomy.'=>'Ko si abajade ti a ri fun taxonomy yii.','You do not have permission to edit this post.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati satunkọ post yii.','You do not have permission to assign terms from this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati yan awọn ọrọ lati taxonomy yii.','Click Term to select or deselect from this %1s'=>'Tẹ Term lati yan tabi yọ jade lati %1s yii','Both Taxonomy and Post are required.'=>'Mejeeji Taxonomy ati Post ni a beere.','No new terms were selected or deselected.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ tuntun ti a yan tabi yọ jade.','%1s terms added to this %2s.'=>'%1s awọn ọrọ ti wa ni afikun si %2s yii.','%1s terms removed from this %2s.'=>'%1s awọn ọrọ ti wa ni yọ kuro ninu %2s yii.','You do not have capability to manage this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni agbara lati ṣakoso taxonomy yii.','You do not have permission to edit this post with this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati satunkọ post yii pẹlu taxonomy yii.','Terms cannot contain the following characters: %s'=>'Awọn ọrọ ko le ni awọn ohun kikọ wọnyi: %s','Terms must be at least %d characters long.'=>'Awọn ọrọ gbọdọ jẹ o kere ju %d awọn ohun kikọ.','Terms cannot exceed %d characters.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ko le kọja %d awọn ohun kikọ.','The Dandelion integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Isopọ Dandelion ti wa ni pipade ni awọn eto Legacy AI Sources.','No matched result from the API Server.'=>'Ko si abajade ti o baamu lati API Server.','The Dandelion integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Isopọ Dandelion nilo API Key. Jọwọ fi API Key rẹ kun ni awọn eto Auto Term.','Selected content is empty.'=>'Ayanfẹ akoonu jẹ ofo.','Result from cache.'=>'Abajade lati cache.','API Error: %1s.'=>'API Aṣiṣe: %1s.','Result from api.'=>'Abajade lati api.','Error establishing connection with the API server. Try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe ti o ṣẹda asopọ pẹlu olupin API. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ LSEG / Refinitiv ti wa ni pipade ninu awọn eto Legacy AI Sources.','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ LSEG / Refinitiv nilo Bọtini API. Jọwọ fi Bọtini API rẹ kun ninu awọn eto Auto Term.','API Error: No matched result for content.'=>'API Aṣiṣe: Ko si abajade ti o baamu fun akoonu.','The IBM Watson integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ IBM Watson ti wa ni pipade ninu awọn eto Legacy AI Sources.','The IBM Watson integration requires an API Key and URL. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ IBM Watson nilo Bọtini API ati URL. Jọwọ fi Bọtini API rẹ kun ninu awọn eto Auto Term.','The IBM Watson API URL must use HTTPS and an official Natural Language Understanding service hostname.'=>'URL API IBM Watson gbọdọ lo HTTPS ati orukọ olupin iṣẹ oye ede adayeba osise.','The OpenAI integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ OpenAI nilo Bọtini API. Jọwọ fi Bọtini API rẹ kun ninu awọn eto Auto Term.','Invalid placeholder(s) detected: {%s}. Valid placeholders are: {content}, {post_terms}, {site_terms}'=>'Iboju ti ko tọ (s) ti a ri: {%s}. Awọn iboju ti o wulo ni: {content}, {post_terms}, {site_terms}','You added {post_terms} in the prompt but your post does not contain any terms.'=>'O ti fi {post_terms} kun ninu iwifunni ṣugbọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ ko ni awọn ọrọ kankan.','You added {site_terms} in the prompt but your site does not contain any terms for this taxonomy.'=>'O ti fi {site_terms} kun ninu iwifunni ṣugbọn aaye rẹ ko ni awọn ọrọ kankan fun taxonomy yii.','Error: OpenAI says there is an issue with this API key. Please check your plan or billing details.'=>'Aṣiṣe: OpenAI sọ pe iṣoro kan wa pẹlu bọtini API yii. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo eto rẹ tabi awọn alaye isanwo.','Show All Existing Terms'=>'Fihan Gbogbo Awọn Ọrọ Tẹlẹ','Manage Post Terms'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn Ọrọ Ifiweranṣẹ','Auto Terms'=>'Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi','Create Terms'=>'Ṣẹda Awọn Ọrọ','View Existing Terms'=>'Wo Awọn Ọrọ Tẹlẹ','This feature allows you to browse all the terms in a taxonomy.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati wa gbogbo awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy kan.','View Current Post Terms'=>'Wo Awọn Ọrọ Ifiweranṣẹ Tí Ó Wà Lọwọlọwọ','This feature allows you to manage all the terms that are currently attached to a post.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣakoso gbogbo awọn ọrọ ti a so mọ ifiweranṣẹ kan ni lọwọlọwọ.','View Terms'=>'Wo Awọn Ọrọ','This feature allows you to browse based on selected auto terms settings and sources.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣawari da lori awọn eto ọrọ aifọwọyi ti a yan ati awọn orisun.','Suggest Terms'=>'Ṣe Iṣeduro Awọn Ọrọ','Select all %1s'=>'Yan gbogbo %1s','Deselect all %1s'=>'Yọ gbogbo %1s','Select %1s'=>'Yan %1s','Please choose a post to use with PublishPress Taxonomies AI.'=>'Jọwọ yan ifiweranṣẹ kan lati lo pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies AI.','Label can\'t be empty.'=>'Aami ko le ṣofo.','Label can\'t exceed 30 characters.'=>'Aami ko le kọja awọn ohun kikọ 30.','Unknown tab type.'=>'Iru taabu ti a ko mọ.','Error saving label.'=>'Aṣiṣe fipamọ aami.','Please choose a post to preview.'=>'Jọwọ yan ifiweranṣẹ kan lati ṣe atunyẹwo.','Metaboxes'=>'Metaboxes','Metabox Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Metabox','Metabox Access'=>'Iwọle Metabox','This feature allows you to customize the metabox interface you see when adding terms to posts.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣe akanṣe oju-iṣẹ metabox ti o rii nigbati o ba n ṣafikun awọn ọrọ si awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Save Changes'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Iyipada','Select...'=>'Yan...','Select %s'=>'Yan %s','Invalid request.'=>'Ibéèrè tí kò tọ́.','No terms in your WordPress database.'=>'Kò sí ìpín kankan nínú ibi ipamọ́ WordPress rẹ.','There\'s no content to scan.'=>'Kò sí akoonu kankan láti ṣayẹwo.','No results from your WordPress database.'=>'Kò sí àbájáde kankan láti ibi ipamọ́ WordPress rẹ.','There are no terms that are relevant to your content.'=>'Kò sí ìpín kankan tí ó ní ibatan pẹ̀lú akoonu rẹ.','Tags'=>'Tags','PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies','This user does not have access to manage any of this post attached taxonomies. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'Olùmúlò yìí kò ní irú ẹ̀tọ́ kankan láti ṣàkóso eyikeyi nínú àwọn taxonomies tí a so mọ́ ìkàwé yìí. Ṣíṣe Metabox Access Taxonomies fún ipa yìí ní %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.','No PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox features are enabled for this post type.'=>'Kò sí àwọn ẹya Metabox PublishPress Taxonomies tí a ti ṣe é fún irú ìkàwé yìí.','Save, You can also press Enter to save and escape to cancel'=>'Fipamọ́, O tún le tẹ Enter láti fi pamọ́ àti Escape láti fagile','Search Terms...'=>'Wá Àmì...','Create Term'=>'Ṣẹda Àmì','You do not have the required capabilities to manage any of this post attached taxonomies.'=>'Iwọ kò ní àwọn agbara tí a nílò láti ṣàkóso eyikeyi nínú àwọn taxonomies tí a so mọ́ ìkàwé yìí.','You can not edit this label.'=>'Iwọ kò le ṣatunkọ́ àkọlé yìí.','Invalid nonce token.'=>'Ibi tí a fi ẹ̀tọ́ kankan jẹ́ àìtó.','Label is too long.'=>'Àkọlé náà pẹ́ ju.','Hey, you\'ve been using PublishPress Taxonomies for %s on your site. We hope the plugin has been useful. Please could you quickly leave a 5-star rating on WordPress.org? It really does help to keep PublishPress Taxonomies growing.'=>'Hey, o ti n lo PublishPress Taxonomies fún %s lórí aaye rẹ. A nireti pé àfikún náà ti wúlò. Jọ̀wọ́, ṣe o le fi ìtẹ́wọ́gbà irawọ̀ 5 sí WordPress.org ní kíákíá? Ó ṣeé ṣe kó ràn wá lọwọ lati jẹ́ kí PublishPress Taxonomies máa dàgbà.','1 week'=>'1 ọ̀sẹ̀','3 months'=>'3 oṣù','Click here to add your rating for PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'Tẹ nibi lati fi iwọn didun rẹ kun fun PublishPress Taxonomies','Maybe later'=>'Boya nigbamii','I already did'=>'Mo ti ṣe tẹlẹ','This plugin can be deleted.'=>'A le pa afikun yii run.','PublishPress Taxonomies was not activated because PublishPress Taxonomies Pro is already active. Please keep only PublishPress Taxonomies Pro enabled.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies ko ti mu ṣiṣẹ nitori PublishPress Taxonomies Pro ti wa ni iṣẹ tẹlẹ. Jọwọ pa PublishPress Taxonomies Pro nikan ṣiṣẹ.','PublishPress Taxonomies: Options'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies: Awọn aṣayan','term nameName'=>'Orukọ','term nameTaxonomy'=>'taxonomy']];